*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
!crates/**
!apps/
!apps/desktop/
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/Cargo.toml
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/build.rs
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/
!apps/desktop/src-tauri/src/**
!deployment/
# Exclude descendants explicitly before allowing individual build/test inputs.
# Re-including the parent alone also re-includes otherwise unlisted files.
deployment/**
!deployment/Dockerfile
!deployment/.env.example
!deployment/compose.yaml
!deployment/*.sh
!deployment/nginx/
!deployment/nginx/*.conf
!deployment/tests/
!deployment/tests/Dockerfile
!deployment/tests/*.sh
!deployment/tests/*.py
